{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "7f44c2711c8f1c68e95b1a14bda5b00df29e81b00c85db4dacce3d913e0b6744", "ja": "GoGo新ユニット！", "zh": "冲啊新组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "660e130c974bee7ce8ce2881308096d21406ae65ecbe825ed177b514feefe547", "ja": "野外会場でのイベント公演を任されたプロデ\nューサーは、劇場でカメラを構える怪しい人\n影、亜利沙を発見。案の定、アイドルを隠し\n撮りしていた彼女と、偶然やってきた3人と\nで、新ユニットを思い付くプロデューサー。", "zh": "负责在户外会场举办活动演出的制作人，发现了在剧场里架着相机的可疑身影——亜利沙。果然，她正在偷拍偶像。制作人和偶然来到这里的3人一起，想到了一个新组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe5990dd262de0ad1a779e929297cac51172c1348fcaf805c63617235183de33", "ja": "（野外音楽会場でのイベント公演か。せっかくだから、\n野外らしく盛り上げたいな。具体的には……）", "zh": "（要在户外音乐会场举办活动公演吗。难得有这个机会，就按户外的风格让现场热闹起来吧。具体来说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4bd0e979a4c072f9154d63d1f2c7584a66ab98a385897208bf274dc87fd44e1b", "ja": "ん？　あそこでカメラを構えている\n怪しげな人物は……見間違えるわけないな……。", "zh": "嗯？在那个地方端着相机的\n可疑人物是……绝不会认错的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "4be6d2e165b3df552ed7c05a951a793843150c924b54997fa827221b706f02ff", "ja": "やはりこっち側で構えておくべきでしょうか……？\nそれとも反対側……？", "zh": "果然还是应该在这边做好准备吗……？\n还是另一边……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "a0406fa72237d120a9c753357fce2095eba1fc7f545544c2d2a1254d9c48c06a", "ja": "顔がきれいに収まるのはこの構図なんですよねぇ……。\nむう、悩ましい……！", "zh": "这个构图能让脸部恰到好处地入镜呢……唔，好难决定啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_1004", "source_sha256": "7961b2bdbe36b2790ae12b8f0dccd9fa5139f7bb123d8f7c56793d2998030fa1", "ja": "肩を叩く", "zh": "搥肩膀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2000_028ari", "source_sha256": "fc2c73361c5d141e12b13b5c623991a82e5aa297f73649c2f6d6970b34a360a4", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　{$P$}さん！？\nこ、これは違うんです！", "zh": "呀！？{$P$}先生！？\n这、这不是你想的那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c34708b0faa034ce90016f8537e0600305ca65e086b91bf95d85538f85edb2e1", "ja": "まだ何も言ってないけど……亜利沙、何をしてたんだ？\n念の為言っておくけど、隠し撮りはダメだぞ。", "zh": "我还什么都没说呢……亚利沙，你在干什么呢？\n我先提醒你一句，偷拍可不行哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2002_028ari", "source_sha256": "959c03cc4e53986eed3e13d914199ea123368c44b73a9f0311324966d27034ab", "ja": "ち、違います！　ありさはただ、風景の写真を\n撮っていただけですから！", "zh": "不、不是！亚利沙只是在拍风景照而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2003_p", "source_sha256": "0f8eecf405b9da51a0ba1b789cb19506ff2b6a5fb045ad7ea6019d37f3085292", "ja": "アイドルが一切写ってないものを？\n亜利沙が？", "zh": "一张偶像都没拍进去的照片？  \n是亚利沙拍的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2004_028ari", "source_sha256": "938606f961483a72e473a8d8c88e31272a09812a129a43caa99cc5a7f4ad850f", "ja": "そ、そうです。こういう写真は、眺めてるだけでも\n面白いですからね！", "zh": "对、对啊。像这种照片，光是看着也很有意思呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2005_028ari", "source_sha256": "66689c409d4121c5be0a26014aed285948a0349209da15fa94e4bcc90abd85ec", "ja": "ほら、自販機の前に椅子が移動したりしてると、\nこのみさんが使ったんだなー、とか分かりますし！", "zh": "你看，要是自动售货机前的椅子被挪动过了，就能知道肯定是木乃美小姐用过了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2006_p", "source_sha256": "d3fe0bcf7951319447b89e069df9232490c1d5b73d8d59d2955575c5a213a1b4", "ja": "このみさん？　小学生のアイドルが自販機のボタンを\n押すために、椅子を使ったんじゃないのか？", "zh": "木实？不是小学生偶像为了按自动售货机的按钮才用椅子的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2007_028ari", "source_sha256": "5ce530394bab31460bb8ab72c6ccf12e2db5a523b7f81c451ecd8e47d7646304", "ja": "桃子ちゃんセンパイは踏み台がありますし、\n育ちゃんと環ちゃんは違うと思います！", "zh": "桃子前辈有脚凳，而且我觉得育和环应该不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2008_028ari", "source_sha256": "c7fde12971a0b8fa9a04ae9c7a90fde16a3aa0bd605673906c854942f4244db9", "ja": "だって、ジュースは自販機の下の段にありますから。\n上の段のコーヒーを買うのは、このみさんかなと。", "zh": "因为果汁在自动售货机的下层嘛。\n要买上层咖啡的，应该是木实小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "c29468f730ec6836acb53f305e3c55459d2a76ca68084425e465b0f1c56b4b98", "ja": "おお、それっぽい推理だな……。風景写真から\nそういう遊びが出来るものなんだな。", "zh": "哦，很像那么回事的推理嘛……没想到从风景照片里也能玩出这种花样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2010_028ari", "source_sha256": "3127377f7f748ff3ecd0849e44294f2d13e59b270bb069e937d86317ab47b149", "ja": "はい！　ありさも初めてやりましたけど、\nちょっと面白いカモって思いました！", "zh": "是的！亚利沙也是第一次玩，不过觉得还挺有意思的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2011_p", "source_sha256": "d84c0350272f2e39a507d9228d929f3d69bd8a29e24795a7af25635d14b46b12", "ja": "ん？　初めて？", "zh": "嗯？第一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2012_009rit", "source_sha256": "1db15437eb61c1602cd2a9cd4e62d3e1ece9146fc23ef1cf75c8d9fddc0452bc", "ja": "どこをほっつき歩いてるのかと思ったら……\nそろそろレッスンの時間よ、亜利沙。", "zh": "我还以为你在外面闲逛到哪儿去了呢……\n差不多该训练了，亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2013_028ari", "source_sha256": "a9d27a6c54d537ee0e9ce27ddaa5c9bc8ef34fc6fb77c6e488214c2b11576a78", "ja": "ひいっ！？　あ、律子さん……！　で、でも、\nありさ達のレッスンには、まだ早いのでは……？", "zh": "呀！？啊，律子姐……！可、可是，\n还没到我们上课的时间吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2014_009rit", "source_sha256": "0641d28766ac4ca84f93d8aa5d39582fddf57548f2d07973ddb793bcf98083a3", "ja": "5分前行動は基本！　それに、亜利沙はダンスレッスン\n苦手でしょ？　先にウォームアップしておきなさい。", "zh": "提前5分钟行动是基本原则！而且，亚利沙你不擅长\n舞蹈课程吧？先去做一下热身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2015_p", "source_sha256": "2a2c2523d9db423ffbd7aa4dff1447daae5a2430042bff96a3fb2da1cc89e6b6", "ja": "お疲れさま、律子。\nこれからレッスンか？", "zh": "辛苦了，律子。\n接下来要去上课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2016_009rit", "source_sha256": "8b90f8f4380efbcc70bc2b7a29edebe9639a4bc2ed5daae6a19cb1c1aafb2fa2", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nええ、そうなんです。亜利沙に、何か用事ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n是的，正是这样。您找亚利沙有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2017_p", "source_sha256": "cd91622cef6764a2d5cb2cfc39eaee5746edacbdcada333f98f1e8d56f844f25", "ja": "いや、亜利沙に用事があったわけじゃないんだ。\nたまたま通りかかっただけで……。", "zh": "没有，我倒不是找亚利沙有事。\n只是刚好路过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2018_009rit", "source_sha256": "169d7ff4ddd278b80c0845a904ae6b4fe2f851523f329fb25ef7b8426f7bcec8", "ja": "そうですか？　それなら、\n亜利沙は借りていきますよ。", "zh": "是这样吗？那样的话，我就把亚利沙借走啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2019_028ari", "source_sha256": "e0fd03a0341a0d41e662ed83876744dd7cd67b20a1ffc282454b398762017a0b", "ja": "ああっ！　律子さん、あとちょっと！\nあとちょっとでレッスンが終わるので！", "zh": "啊！律子小姐，再坚持一下！\n再过一会儿练习就结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2020_009rit", "source_sha256": "a159a5fc43ce61c4021e606adf012b940c14f21f44532800e2d5d7a6044c3a5d", "ja": "レッスンが終わる？\nレッスンが始まるの間違いでしょ？", "zh": "要结束练习了？\n你说的是要开始练习了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2021_028ari", "source_sha256": "118d048cac16b0ff7fb76309265d93bd98987fee3f7778e1d2e69d49545f6209", "ja": "あっ！　いえっ、その……！", "zh": "啊！不、不是的，那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2022_035hin", "source_sha256": "25a335e59d9498fa4d32486295c4551fb7f2d90a51a03a5323b2b9b064e680b7", "ja": "あれぇ？　3人とも、\nこんなところでなにしてるんだい？", "zh": "咦？你们3个人怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2023_019min", "source_sha256": "d4a3f34a86316fcb74c7e5234d772b99bb9877aaaa21846410e879d9cb713bae", "ja": "もしかして……お腹が空いて\n私を探しに来たのかな？", "zh": "难道说……是因为肚子饿了，\n所以跑来找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2024_009rit", "source_sha256": "831e0b26300725a98a25dc3f34482c5755e7f9600112cb9b9d503ded6fc6da37", "ja": "あら、ひなたに美奈子。\n今日はふたりとも、ボイスレッスンだったかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，是日向和美奈子。今天你们两个都上声乐课了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2025_019min", "source_sha256": "9d7e2dfb7192686bef12e096feeb6bc19d37a843c130238d9b7e247f633cdfaa", "ja": "はい、ちょうど今終わったところです。\nばっちりカロリー消費してきましたよ！", "zh": "是的，正好刚刚结束。\n我们可是好好消耗了一番卡路里呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2026_035hin", "source_sha256": "99846270308a5fefb0ae318dd1e9c24aa63f9cd557ebe1b645b9d4bb9ef0c0be", "ja": "今日は、先生にたくさんほめてもらえたから、\nあたしも張り切ってしまったんだよぉ。", "zh": "今天老师夸了我好多，所以我也不由得干劲十足了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2027_p", "source_sha256": "625e480861d5c64a3b8c1f0620dc513953d2317405878b1b3a63925253a8a67d", "ja": "……なるほど。レッスン終わりの2人を撮るために、\nここでスタンバイしていた、というわけか……。", "zh": "……原来如此。也就是说，为了拍下结束训练的2个人，你才在这里待命吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2028_028ari", "source_sha256": "606f6c64443985608ae2c696766ec6e69d889c44d5a40596d389c62715b03a8a", "ja": "い、いえ！　そそそそんなつもりはありません！\n……ただ、亜利沙が風景を撮っている時に……。", "zh": "没、没有！我绝绝绝绝对没有那个意思！\n……只是，在亚利沙拍风景的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2029_028ari", "source_sha256": "1940f6113f3607ce639740dcd00cd1a55132e24e25029362fa1eee0f5b999a7b", "ja": "アイドルちゃんがうっかりフレームイン！……という\nコトはあるかもしれません♪　偶然！　事故で！", "zh": "也许会有偶像女孩一不小心闯进镜头！……这种事发生♪ 偶然！是意外！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2030_p", "source_sha256": "a6e58ba8aaf90fc00d532940dff61001711a8e11a9233dc3b1b25ff27c190824", "ja": "だんだん知恵がまわるようになってきたな……。\n今回の場合、悪い意味でだけど……。", "zh": "渐渐变得越来越机灵了啊……。\n不过这次是往坏的方面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2031_009rit", "source_sha256": "addbf14ce1bf04bddca18b83df9be97186034966d92043cbc8a56caf74a82513", "ja": "ふうん。亜利沙は自分のレッスンより、他の\nアイドルのレッスンに熱心になってたってことね？", "zh": "哦——也就是说，亚利沙比起自己的训练，更热衷于其他偶像的训练咯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2032_028ari", "source_sha256": "cbc3b8bac80bc9ccdb99fc3001e14f2c03378ec48e5c29e168a5dd839bf7b57a", "ja": "あっ！　い、いえっ、\n決してそういうわけでは……！", "zh": "啊！没、没有，\n绝不是那样的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2033_035hin", "source_sha256": "9e5b07739d5a28a7f9e481e52e2609eab9c3ddcdae77554605839d5efc4c376f", "ja": "亜利沙さん、あたし達のレッスンを\n見たかったってことかい？", "zh": "亚利沙小姐，原来你是想看我们的训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2034_019min", "source_sha256": "2020d8359f9566ea5980da48d5883333eb3bc0c12e8f8181e8dd59558f4514f8", "ja": "私とひなたちゃん、今からダンスレッスンなんだけど、\nよかったら合同でする？", "zh": "我和小日向接下来要上舞蹈课，要不要一起上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2035_028ari", "source_sha256": "475ba4b9f48e7f441e030acc916c3de49e2dea645876c4ab53a8c88ed1c86141", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか！？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2036_019min", "source_sha256": "aedd39137f39178a09bc2be73336aef5352c95ddb30287c440d558938dcaa62d", "ja": "もちろん！　どうせなら、\nセットメニューの方がお得でしょ？", "zh": "当然啦！既然这样，选套餐不是更划算吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2037_035hin", "source_sha256": "6ada57cf76b278d436b3c67e851e3c90d37254f4f3cfada5e204724f14f4acac", "ja": "一緒にレッスンしたほうが、楽しいからねぇ。\nあたしも大歓迎だよ。", "zh": "一起上课会更开心嘛。\n我也非常欢迎哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2038_009rit", "source_sha256": "d3a700b67991f283e92383a4177f0d29cbffacfab4175972ca612c77c2ebf4ea", "ja": "まったく、みんな優しいんだから……。", "zh": "真是的，大家都太温柔了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2039_009rit", "source_sha256": "d6a6f26b9607082a036452055e8be7e88ee2161efa5e5bce671e99931c4f5eb2", "ja": "でも、亜利沙のモチベーションも上がるみたいだし……\nふたりさえよければ、一緒にやりましょうか。", "zh": "不过，看来也能提高亚利沙的干劲……\n\n要是你们两位没意见，就一起做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2040_p", "source_sha256": "95755651cfca5a17d331f91508c41c4198eb23fcab899d761436bd1a49387755", "ja": "4人で一緒にレッスン……なるほど……。\n特典映像は、レッスン風景というのもアリだな……。", "zh": "4个人一起上课……原来如此……\n特典影像拍练习时的情景也是个不错的选择啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_01_2041_p", "source_sha256": "4028b6713235ea8847db0f23fc98100fc3488a207d7015fce5e431001c80be8c", "ja": "うん、悪くない……いや、むしろアリだ！\n今回はこの4人でいこう！", "zh": "嗯，不错……不，应该说很可以！这次就定这4个人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
